 "lines": [
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Fryer Radio midweek! Nigel, I want to talk about luck. Specifically, how much Danna has been kissed this week."
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Danna's starters are 74 points above their projections. That's 13 percent. Ten different players shooting over fifty percent."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Start with Ty Jerome! A five dollar waiver pickup!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Forty-five points on night two. Seventeen of twenty-five from the field. Then twenty-eight last night. Thirty-seven a game, from the bargain bin."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "And Pandemic P! Paul George!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Thirty-eight points in his Celtics debut. Seven threes, five steals. Danna is paying him one dollar."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "One dollar! I've paid more for a Zinger box!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Then there's Walker Kessler. Twelve of twelve from the field on night two. Twenty-two points, six blocks and three steals last night. Twenty-two of twenty-six for the week."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "And the cherry on top, Nigel!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Domantas Sabonis. Twenty-seven points, nineteen rebounds, ten assists. A triple double, last night. Our own website had him tagged as injured two days ago."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Kissed! Kissed on both cheeks! Somebody check Danna's lineup for horseshoes!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Which brings us to Mamba. Seventy points below projection. Thirteen percent. The coldest team in the league, shooting 44.5 percent as a team."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Name names, Nigel!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Josh Giddey. Four of nineteen from the field. Four points a game, projected eighteen. Jamal Murray, two of eleven. LaMelo Ball, eleven of thirty. Luka, fifteen of thirty-nine."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "And the big panic pickup?"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Joel Embiid. Twelve of thirty-one."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Mamba is on full tilt! Panic-added Embiid, cut Derik Queen, and left 179 points on the bench this week!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Spare a thought for Slav, then. Thirty points under projection. Under. And still leading eight to one."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Because they drew Mamba! Slav has been kissed on the pecker by the schedule!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Injury report. Bizzle, look away. Cooper Flagg and Cedric Coward are out. LeBron James, AJ Dybantsa and Paolo Banchero, all day to day."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "The injuries are coming for Bizzle! Brace! Brace!"
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "That's the midweek! Lineups lock with the first game each day. Don't leave a rabbit in your hat!"
  }
 ],
